WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.010
So you said you and Robert were partners,

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.660
but it was Robert's name on the business, correct?

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:05.120
Yeah.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.200
He started the practice and then I joined after.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.570
Uh, Captain, something's come up in the case.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.780
Can I talk to you outside for a sec?

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.560
What the hell are you doing in there?

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.800
You totally undermined me.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.680
I know, and I apologize, but I'm executing a strategy.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.080
Oh, really, and what strategy might that be?

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.400
Make Jake feel like an idiot,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.560
or make Jake feel self conscious about his Addams Family themed wedding vows rap?

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.460
No, I want Philip to underestimate you and fear me.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.160
I'll badger him with my superior intellect, while simultaneously belittling you.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.440
Once Philip dismisses you as a threat,

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.770
I'll leave you alone with him, and he'll let his guard down.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:39.200
If I didn't know any better, I would say you're describing smart cop dumb cop.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.400
Look, I thought you had him on the calendar reveal.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:42.620
But he was a step ahead.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.680
You got flustered, and I realized in the moment we could use this to our advantage.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.500
So what do you want me to do, ask stupid questions?

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.760
Stupid questions, grammatical errors, lose your train of thought, just ask him to confess.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.400
ooh, relate everything back to those movies you've seen.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.460
Kinda seems like a shot at me about Die Hard, but okay.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.480
This is not a comment on you, Peralta.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.060
I just want to bring this guy down.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.680
Yeah, that's all I want too.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:06.880
And to possibly say, You can't handle the tooth.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.020
You know, if it comes up naturally.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:09.740
It won't.

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:10.080
It might.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:11.140
I actually think.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.600
It can't.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:13.900
So what do you say?

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:17.080
Me want to.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:18.880
Dumb cop.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:19.580
I got that.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:19.960
Yeah.

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:20.480
Well done.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:21.100
Mm hmm.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:24.500
So, the night of the murder, you met with Robert in the surgical suite.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.090
Why there?

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:25.740
Why not your office?

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:27.540
Uh, just preparing for the next day's surgeries.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.340
Don't you have an assistant does that?

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.560
I'm a meticulous person.
